<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Tesseract - 标签 - 春和景明-Spaceack's Blog</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/tags/tesseract/</link><description>Tesseract - 标签 - 春和景明-Spaceack's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</managingEditor><webMaster>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</webMaster><copyright>This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 25 Aug 2017 12:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://spaceack.github.io/tags/tesseract/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Ubuntu16.04 下编译安装tesseract 4.00.00alpha 及测试</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20170825-ubuntu16-04%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85tesseract4/</link><pubDate>Fri, 25 Aug 2017 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20170825-ubuntu16-04%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85tesseract4/</guid><description><![CDATA[<ol>
<li>3.05.01 及 以后的版本没有Linux的二进制包,需要编译安装.</li>
</ol>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 安装相关组件</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install g++ <span class="c1"># or clang++ (presumably)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install autoconf automake libtool
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install autoconf-archive
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install pkg-config
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install libpng12-dev
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install libjpeg8-dev
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install libtiff5-dev
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install zlib1g-dev
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install libicu-dev
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install libpango1.0-dev
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo apt-get install libcairo2-dev</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<ol start="2">
<li>依赖图像库<a href="http://www.leptonica.org/download.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">Leptonica</a>,在编译tesseract前先编译Leptonica, 版本对应关系见<a href="https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract/wiki/Compiling#linux" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">Compiling#linux</a>,3.05对应<a href="http://www.leptonica.org/source/leptonica-1.74.tar.gz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">leptonica-1.74.tar.gz</a></li>
</ol>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">wget http://www.leptonica.org/source/leptonica-1.74.tar.gz
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">tar -xvf leptonica-1.74.tar.gz
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">cd</span> leptonica-1.74
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">./configure 
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">make
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">make install</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<ol start="3">
<li>编译安装tesseract 4.00.00alpha</li>
</ol>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">git clone https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract.git
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">cd</span> tesseract
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">./autogen.sh
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">./configure 
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">make
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">make install</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract/wiki" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">wiki</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="python3-调用">python3 调用</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo pip3 install pytesseract</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-python">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span> <span class="nn">pytesseract</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">vcode</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">pytesseract</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">image_to_string</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">im</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">lang</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s1">&#39;eng&#39;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">config</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s1">&#39;-psm 12 --tessdata-dir /tessdata/&#39;</span><span class="p">)</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>]]></description></item></channel></rss>